# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5, cuda
# The Coulomb modifier of the Python model on a GPU
# (D[python-coulomb-modifier]): PME shifted at the cutoff against mdir run.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_coulomb_modifier.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide GPU mdir %t | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: GPU Double: the state at step 10 equals that of mdir run to the bit
# CHECK: GPU Double: the shift changes the potential
# CHECK: GPU Mixed: rows within
# CHECK: coulomb modifier passed
